{"a":[61,67],"h":"<p>61.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"134\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 134.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.0 33.8 33.8 41.3 55.6 55.6 68.3 68.3 77.3 77.3 84.8 100.6 111.0 111.0\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 41.3 100.6 117.8\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ıhzar edilenlerden - IHZAR, yakalanıp hakkın huzuruna getirilmek. 63.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"178\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 177.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 23.3 23.3 30.0 30.0 36.7 45.0 63.0 69.7 78.7 99.0 99.0 108.0 108.0 117.0 123.7 130.4 130.4 137.3 145.4 145.4 154.4\" y=\"26.3 26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.3 36.7 45.0 69.7 78.7 123.7 137.3 154.4 161.3\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> biz onları kendi azdığımız gibi azdırdık - ya'ni biz kendi hevamızla azdığımız gibi onları da cebr ile değil, kendi hevalarıyla azdırdık <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"186\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 185.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.0 35.3 35.3 44.3 44.3 51.0 51.0 57.7 73.6 80.3 87.0 93.7 93.7 100.6 100.6 116.3 123.0 123.0 131.3 131.3 138.0 144.7 156.0 162.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 57.7 80.3 93.7 144.7 162.7 169.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> onlar bize tapmıyorlardı - kendi keyflerine tapıyorlardı.</p>"}